EVALUATION.md §13: a spread-copied field holding a list, a map, a record, a table or a keyed list
is `spread` at the spread with via the original provenance of the copied value, as a scalar is;
the values inside keep theirs, findings about the copied value stay at that original provenance,
and a ref into the spread-copied keyed list resolves as in the source (§4.2, DECISIONS 410).
